		// not the prose, and somebody who expects Obsidian's own search will
		// otherwise conclude the box is broken rather than different.
		find.title = 'Search names and folders. Words are combined with AND.\nThis searches names, not the text inside notes — use Obsidian’s own search for that.';
		// TOMBSTONE (Phase 5): the SORT and FILTER buttons and their menus
		// (`sortBtn`, `filterBtn`, `openFilterMenu`, the filter set and its
