		// and the column menu's 'Sort by' group. History and Export are
		// navigators over the book's own order now; the one place a sort
		// exists is the Organizer table's lens. `sort` stays 'order' for
		// ever, so the sorted-tree branches below it are unreachable, and
		// rows are ALWAYS draggable.
