		// THE COLUMN LIST, BUILT ONCE. The eye button and a right-click on
		// the band both end with it, and the moment there were two copies one
		// of them would gain a column the other did not — which is the fault
		// that left the Blocked flag grey for a release.
		// TOMBSTONE: `ORG_COL_FAMILIES`, lifted to this scope on 2026-08-28
