		// TOMBSTONE (brief C3, 2026-08-28): `orgPropsChecklist` and
		// `orgPropsSearch` stood here — the Outline-only checklist of
		// frontmatter keys and the uncapped picker under it. Both are the
		// Properties PANEL below now, which is the same list in both modes.
		// ── THE PROPERTIES PANEL: ONE ROW MODEL, BOTH SURFACES (brief C3) ──
		//
		// TOMBSTONE, TWO OF THEM: `orgPropsChecklist` — the Outline's
		// checklist of frontmatter keys, capped at twelve and preceded by the
